From 237448870997096fce7eefaa0ecfe3f2801b2bbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:19:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] service: the real news module with the online modules

With the real BOSS module, SpotPass letters only reach the Notifications applet when the real
news module runs: the HLE news service gets nothing from it. Tested 17 Oct 2026 with 0120
(BOSS extdata on the NAND): Badge Arcade letters arrive in Notifications. NEWS now loads with
the other online modules (FRD, NDM, NIM, BOSS...); without its title on the NAND the HLE
version is used as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
---
 BUILD-NUMBER                     | 2 +-
 src/core/hle/service/service.cpp | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/BUILD-NUMBER b/BUILD-NUMBER
index 9289ddcee..9f54fe313 100644
--- a/BUILD-NUMBER
+++ b/BUILD-NUMBER
@@ -1 +1 @@
-121
+122
